{"type":"npc","name":"Nightmare Shade","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":100,"temp":0,"max":100,"details":"void healing"},"ac":{"value":26,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":null,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":25}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"death-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"frightened","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"precision","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"all-damage","value":6,"exceptions":["force","ghost-touch","spirit","vitality","weapons-shedding-bright-light"],"doubleVs":["non-magical"]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","necril","shadowtongue"],"details":""},"level":{"value":8},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>A nightmare shade is a malevolent spirit that can form when a sentient being dies in a state of abject terror. Fragments of that being's soul become trapped in its shadow, animating it into a twisted creature whose continued existence depends on feeding on the fear of others.</p><h2>They Go Bump in the Night</h2><p>Densely populated areas are the most common places to find nightmare shades. They hide in gutters, attics, and other dark places during the day. At night, they emerge, silently entering houses in search of potential prey. Once inside, they create flickers of ominous shadows and snippets of eerie sounds to taste the fear of their targets. When they find someone whose fear is particularly rich, they depart, waiting for their prey to fall asleep before returning to plague them, preferring to return to the same victim many times, as the cumulative anxiety and trauma inflicted by their visits enhance the nourishment they receive.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 64/140/250 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Intimidation, Occultism, Stealth)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> charisma, death, darkness, dexterity, energy resistant (acid, cold, electricity, fire, sonic, void), fortification, intelligence, mind, mind shield, sensory (darkvision), spells (Occult: @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.o4lRVTwSxnOOn5vl]{Sleep}), throwing, unholy, wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Jake Marohl","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":-5},"dex":{"mod":6},"con":{"mod":0},"int":{"mod":3},"wis":{"mod":2},"cha":{"mod":6}},"perception":{"details":"fearsense (imprecise) 60 feet","mod":16,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":13,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":19,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":15,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":18},"intimidation":{"base":18},"occultism":{"base":17},"stealth":{"base":18}},"traits":{"value":["incorporeal","shadow","undead","unholy"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"liYjA8FnoevbQC6f","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/nightmare-shade.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Nightmare Shade","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/nightmare-shade.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/nightmare-shade.webp"}},"flags":{"sf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"name":"Occult Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":18,"dc":26},"tradition":{"value":"occult"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null}},"_id":"FRflt46q5BiMHCoD","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"folder":"T8AzYUgNIAgTJ9Iz","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/sleep.webp","name":"Sleep","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Each creature in the area becomes drowsy and might fall asleep. A creature that falls @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} from this spell doesn't fall @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone} or release what it's holding. This spell doesn't prevent creatures from waking up due to a successful Perception check, limiting its utility in combat.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes a -1 status penalty to Perception checks for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature falls Unconscious. If it's still Unconscious after 1 minute, it wakes up automatically.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature falls Unconscious. If it's still Unconscious after 1 hour, it wakes up automatically.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The creatures fall Unconscious for 1 round on a failure or 1 minute on a critical failure. They fall Prone and release what they're holding, and they can't attempt Perception checks to wake up. When the duration ends, the creature is sleeping normally instead of automatically waking up.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"sleep","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","incapacitation","manipulate","mental","sleep"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":5},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"FRflt46q5BiMHCoD","heightenedLevel":4,"uses":{"max":2,"value":2}},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.o4lRVTwSxnOOn5vl","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"0ngdesq9508H4mCK"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Void Healing","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"void-healing","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.TTCw5NusiSSkJU1x","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"hHHI83pG110s2mY7"},{"type":"action","name":"Fearsense","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The nightmare shade is aware of all frightened creatures within the listed range.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"BmhdQnUlT8Tej3NR","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Light Vulnerability","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>An object shedding magical light (such as from the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.WBmvzNDfpwka3qT4] spell) is treated as though it has the <em>ghost touch</em> property when used to attack the nightmare shade.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"348JVar6uKGw7xVA","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Terrifying Touch","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["finesse","magical","mental","unarmed"]},"damageRolls":{"Oo4LNgQh8SueOpbu":{"damage":"4d6","damageType":"mental","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":20},"attackEffects":{"value":["nightmare-visions"]}},"_id":"S4XNAQt4RoqgTQlt","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Cloying Shadow","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["magical","range-100","void"]},"damageRolls":{"bC68dDKxfpRRwqmI":{"damage":"4d6","damageType":"void","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":20},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"VJhim7FxlzJQViqC","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Nightmare Visions","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>When the nightmare shade damages a creature with their terrifying touch, the creature must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:24] save or become @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} on a critical failure).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["emotion","fear","mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"fu2tMW4bODcwNgkn","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Consume Fear","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The nightmare shade consumes the terror of an adjacent frightened creature.</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The creature takes @Damage[4d8[mental]] damage (@Check[will|dc:26|basic] save). If the creature failed the saving throw, the nightmare shade gains 5 temporary Hit Points (10 on a critical failure). Regardless of the result, the target's frightened condition is reduced by 1.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"3rvmPINinAWRWqbF","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Helpless Awakening","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The nightmare shade targets an @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} creature that is not dying within 30 feet. The creature wakes up; if they were at 0 Hit Points, they regain 1 Hit Point. The creature must then attempt a @Check[will|dc:26] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed}. It can attempt a new Will save at the end of each of its turns to end the condition. The DC starts at 26 and cumulatively decreases by 1 on each attempt.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the DC does not cumulatively decrease.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["emotion","fear","incapacitation","mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"XQ4RuLWD8ukuky64","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Night Terrors","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The nightmare shade produces a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30] of black smoke. The smoke extinguishes all sources of nonmagical light and attempts to counteract any source of magical light within the area (counteract modifier [[/r 1d20+16 #Counteract]]{+16}). Creatures in the area take @Damage[5d6[mental]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[will|dc:26] save). The nightmare shade can't use Night Terrors again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Night Terrors]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage and is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3}, and is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused} for 1 round as their senses are overtaken with their worst fears.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","darkness","emotion","fear","mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"7Bam6h8PkRSa62Mw","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Enduring Torment","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>Whenever a nightmare shade deals mental damage, they can choose to make the damage nonlethal.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"SeZv8uaR77kujhjI","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":4900000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"}}